<title>UK: London gold fixes $2.00 firmer, meeting resistance.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes $2.00 firmer, meeting resistance.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixes firmer at $346.30 vs $344.30 on Monday PM. Market oversold and may push up towards $350 area if it can breach problematic $346.50 resistance.</p>
<p>SILVER - Unchanged at $4.90/$4.92.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Down just $0.25 at $351.50/$352.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Barely changed at $125.50/$126.50.</p>
</text>
